00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:13.740
We believe we are functioning as though we
are in the endemic phase.

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:17.820
We are going to start removing restrictions
and kind of putting this at the individual

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:23.290
level to say if if I have a particular reason
that I need to go beyond what's required of

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:27.170
me by by the state, I'm going to do it based
on my level of risk.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.920
Does that make any sense to you at this point
